-- Story 26.4 (UC-CHK-015) Schedule 11 late-correction fixtures: seven mill/years, all reporting year 2021, all ACT,
-- REPORT_COMPLETED_IND 'N'. The silviculture track is 'V' on every mill (category '11' at 'V'); the 1-10 track is
-- 'S', 'D' or 'V' per mill, with categories '1'..'10' at the state that track implies ('S' -> 'A', 'D' -> 'D',
-- 'V' -> 'V'). Where a write succeeds (817) the two codes DIFFER (1-10 'S' / silviculture 'V', the real S/V pair on
-- delivery), so a write that reached the wrong track's status or categories fails a test instead of coinciding with
-- the right answer.
--
-- 'S' AUDIT SNAPSHOT ROWS, as R__58 seeds them: the application never writes *_AUD rows and the test schema has no
-- trigger (V20260910:18-32), so the Licensee's submission is seeded directly. At Verified the snapshot views still
-- read the latest 'S' row -- the trigger stamps an admin save at V as 'V' ((V,V)->V), never 'S' -- so the baseline a
-- late correction is compared against is the Licensee's submission, not the value at verification.
--
--   816  Schedule11OriginalValuesIT   -- read-only indicator anchor (NEVER written), 1-10 'V': 9441's snapshot differs
--                                        on all five tracked fields (submitted BEC 8802 'CWHvm'); 9442 was corrected by
--                                        the ministry at S -- its later 'A' (admin save at S) and 'V' (verify touch)
--                                        audit rows carry the ministry's values, and the view must skip both
--   817  Schedule11LateCorrectionIT   -- the one mill WRITTEN: Add + bulk save (delete 9444, and 9443 takes over 9444's
--                                        biogeo+location in the same save) + a second correction; 9443's Actual cost
--                                        ALSO has an 'S' row under an OLDER detail id (5898, absent from the base
--                                        table) with a HIGHER audit id; 9445 is never sent; a LICENSEE and an AUDITOR
--                                        pair on the status row, both proven untouched. 1-10 'S'
--   818  Schedule11LateCorrectionIT   -- Check Status flags (NEVER written): 9446's two cost rows exist with COST NULL
--   819  Schedule11LateCorrectionIT   -- Check Status all met (NEVER written), 1-10 'S'
--   820  Schedule11LateCorrectionIT   -- refusal tables, malformed bodies, multi-error, unique-key clash (NEVER written)
--   821  Schedule11LateCorrectionIT   -- stale revision (9451 at REVISION_COUNT 3), unknown id (NEVER written), 1-10 'S'
--   822  Schedule11LateCorrectionIT   -- the SUBMITTER at V: Add + bulk save refused, check-status answered (NEVER written)
--
-- Prefix 61 is BELOW 70 so R__70's set-based insert associates the canonical submitter to all seven mills. It rides
-- the db/ chain, so these mills also appear in the e2e database (as R__57-R__59's do). The two directory users on
-- 817's pairs are R__59's (VERIFY11LICENSEE..., VERIFY11OLDAUDITOR...); R__59 runs first, and each pair's FK needs
-- 817's xref row, inserted before the status row.
--
-- Claims (bare-id grep over backend/src/test and frontend/e2e on 2026-09-25, per table): MILL /
-- ILCR_MILL_STATUS_XREF 816-822 (MILL_NUMBER 1816-1822); BASIC_SILVICULTURE_REPORT 9441-9455 (9441-9452 used; below
-- ILCR_REPORT_COMMON_SEQ's 9500); ILCR_COST_REPORT_DETAIL 5870-5898 (5870-5893 used as rows, 5898 ONLY as an audit
-- row's detail id; 5899 is R__58's; below the 9000 floor); BASIC_SILVICULTURE_RPRT_AUD_ID 1011-1030 (1011-1017 used;
-- nothing above 1010 is seeded) and ILCR_COST_REPORT_DETAIL_AUD_ID 2013-2040 (2013-2020 and 2022-2026 used; 2021 is
-- SKIPPED because it is the report year on nearly every fixture line, so a bare-id grep could never prove it free;
-- nothing above 2012 is seeded) -- no sequence backs either audit id. Bare 10xx hits elsewhere are ILCR_REPORT_SUMMARY_IDs, not audit ids.
-- Every INSERT is the single-row `(cols) SELECT ... FROM DUAL WHERE NOT EXISTS` form guarded on its key (README
-- convention 1b).
-- ================================================================================================
-- Mill 816 -- Sch11 Late Originals Milling (MILL_NUMBER 1816). 1-10 at V, silviculture at V.
-- ================================================================================================
INSERT INTO THE.MILL (MILL_ID, MILL_NAME, MILL_NUMBER, ENTRY_USERID)
  SELECT 816, 'Sch11 Late Originals Milling', 1816, 'SEED' FROM DUAL
   WHERE NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM THE.MILL WHERE MILL_ID = 816);
INSERT INTO THE.ILCR_MILL_STATUS_XREF (ILCR_MILL_STATUS_XREF_ID, ILCR_MILL_STATUS_CODE, ENTRY_USERID)
  SELECT 816, 'ACT', 'SEED' FROM DUAL
   WHERE NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM THE.ILCR_MILL_STATUS_XREF WHERE ILCR_MILL_STATUS_XREF_ID = 816);
